WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:01.000 --> 00:00:02.535
-Thank you very much, everyone.

00:00:02.535 --> 00:00:06.639
Welcome, welcome, welcome,
welcome to "The Tonight Show"!

00:00:06.639 --> 00:00:09.141
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:00:09.141 --> 00:00:10.710
Thank you for being here.

00:00:10.710 --> 00:00:13.312
Well, guys, I hope everyone
had a good weekend.

00:00:13.312 --> 00:00:16.583
I needed a break, so yesterday
I flew to Cancun and back.

00:00:16.583 --> 00:00:18.451
[ Laughter ]

00:00:18.451 --> 00:00:20.253
Yeah, everyone is still talking
about this.

00:00:20.253 --> 00:00:22.655
Following the backlash
over his trip to Cancun,

00:00:22.655 --> 00:00:25.658
Senator Ted Cruz spent
the weekend trying his best

00:00:25.658 --> 00:00:27.360
to help the people of Texas.

00:00:27.360 --> 00:00:29.696
-Senator Ted Cruz
doing damage control

00:00:29.696 --> 00:00:32.798
after his controversial trip
to Cancun last week.

00:00:32.798 --> 00:00:35.034
-Cruz sharing these images
over the weekend,

00:00:35.034 --> 00:00:36.936
loading water into Texans' cars,

00:00:36.936 --> 00:00:39.539
many online critical
of the post.

00:00:39.539 --> 00:00:42.008
-Yeah, people were upset
when they realized

00:00:42.008 --> 00:00:43.877
Cruz was loading water
into his car.

00:00:43.877 --> 00:00:45.311
[ Laughter ]

00:00:45.311 --> 00:00:47.380
"I'm gonna use this
to refill my waterbed."

00:00:47.380 --> 00:00:51.284
[ Laughter ]

00:00:51.284 --> 00:00:53.786
Yeah, it seemed like
an okay gesture until everyone

00:00:53.786 --> 00:00:56.822
noticed the label on the bottles
said Ritz Carlton Cancun.

00:00:56.822 --> 00:00:59.758
[ Laughter ]
A little souvenir.

00:00:59.758 --> 00:01:01.427
Actually,
Cruz wanted to do more,

00:01:01.427 --> 00:01:05.064
but he had a parasailing lesson
at 3:00, so he --

00:01:05.064 --> 00:01:08.634
People were also upset that Cruz
tweeted those pictures himself.

00:01:08.634 --> 00:01:11.104
Even white people
who only posted black squares

00:01:11.104 --> 00:01:13.172
on Instagram were like,
"You gotta do more than that."

00:01:13.172 --> 00:01:17.443
[ Laughter ]

00:01:17.443 --> 00:01:20.213
Ted Cruz is like the friend
who offers to help you move,

00:01:20.213 --> 00:01:21.414
but every time you see him,

00:01:21.414 --> 00:01:23.015
he's just carrying
the same box of pillows.

00:01:23.015 --> 00:01:25.384
It's like, "I have to take this
call. Can you get the table?

00:01:25.384 --> 00:01:28.822
Hello. Yeah. Yeah, just get
the heavy things."

00:01:28.822 --> 00:01:30.924
Yep, the photo-op
didn't work out too well.

00:01:30.924 --> 00:01:32.424
Most people just drove away

00:01:32.424 --> 00:01:34.427
when he tried showing them
his vacation photos.

00:01:34.427 --> 00:01:36.328
He's like,
"You ever think you can get

00:01:36.328 --> 00:01:37.797
behind the bar
at a Senior Frog's?"

00:01:37.797 --> 00:01:39.332
[ Laughter ]

00:01:39.332 --> 00:01:41.767
But Cruz tried to be helpful
in other ways.

00:01:41.767 --> 00:01:44.170
Later, he showed Texans
how to make frozen margs

00:01:44.170 --> 00:01:45.805
with the snow
in their living rooms.

00:01:45.805 --> 00:01:47.607
[ Audience oohs ]

00:01:47.607 --> 00:01:50.276
Seriously, you know Cruz
is having a rough 2021

00:01:50.276 --> 00:01:52.278
when fueling a riot
at the Capitol is

00:01:52.278 --> 00:01:53.880
nowhere near
his biggest problem.

00:01:53.880 --> 00:01:55.448
[ Laughter ]

00:01:55.448 --> 00:01:58.084
Things are so bad for Cruz,
he spent today thinking about

00:01:58.084 --> 00:01:59.852
the good ol' days
when people just thought

00:01:59.852 --> 00:02:01.253
he was the Zodiac Killer.

00:02:01.253 --> 00:02:06.692
[ Laughter and applause ]

00:02:06.692 --> 00:02:08.360
Also, we're in a pandemic.

00:02:08.360 --> 00:02:11.230
Shaking hands, handing out
water, serving food.

00:02:11.230 --> 00:02:13.967
Right now, a Carnival cruise
is safer than a Ted Cruz.

00:02:13.967 --> 00:02:16.135
[ Laughter ]

00:02:16.135 --> 00:02:18.137
Yeah, Cruz is trying
to redeem himself

00:02:18.137 --> 00:02:20.606
after his Mexico trip,
but I don't think it's working.

00:02:20.606 --> 00:02:23.476
Check out what fellow Texans
sent to his house yesterday.

00:02:23.476 --> 00:02:24.677
This is real.

00:02:24.677 --> 00:02:31.350 line:0%
♪♪

00:02:31.350 --> 00:02:32.885
Yeah.
[ Laughter ]

00:02:32.885 --> 00:02:35.254
[ Applause ]

00:02:35.254 --> 00:02:36.588
That's real.

00:02:36.588 --> 00:02:39.291
In honor of Cruz, they played
that mariachi classic,

00:02:39.291 --> 00:02:40.660
"El Baggo de Douche."

00:02:40.660 --> 00:02:42.795
[ Laughter ]

00:02:42.795 --> 00:02:45.098
Meanwhile, Cruz was like,
"Play as loud as you want.

00:02:45.098 --> 00:02:46.532
I'm in Tijuana."

00:02:46.532 --> 00:02:48.401
[ Laughter ]

00:02:48.401 --> 00:02:51.003
Some entertainment news --
I saw that Disney+ has added

00:02:51.003 --> 00:02:53.406
a warning to a show
that you might not expect.

00:02:53.406 --> 00:02:54.507
Watch this.

00:02:54.507 --> 00:02:56.943
-The return of the iconic
"Muppet Show,"

00:02:56.943 --> 00:02:59.612
now coming with
a serious new warning --

00:02:59.612 --> 00:03:03.916
a content disclaimer at
the beginning of 18 episodes,

00:03:03.916 --> 00:03:07.219
warning viewers of the program's
"negative depictions

00:03:07.219 --> 00:03:10.290
and/or mistreatment
of people or cultures."

00:03:10.290 --> 00:03:12.124
-Yeah, and just to be safe,

00:03:12.124 --> 00:03:14.260
Gonzo's nose
will also be blurred.

00:03:14.260 --> 00:03:18.363
[ Laughter ]

00:03:18.363 --> 00:03:19.698
I think they made
the right move.

00:03:19.698 --> 00:03:22.235
In one episode, Fozzie
does a stand-up routine

00:03:22.235 --> 00:03:24.237
that begins with,
"hickory, dickory, dock."

00:03:24.237 --> 00:03:28.274
[ Laughter ]

00:03:28.274 --> 00:03:29.942
Here's some big music news.

00:03:29.942 --> 00:03:34.346
After 28 years together,
Daft Punk is splitting up.

00:03:34.346 --> 00:03:36.616
I'm gonna be honest,
they picked a pretty weird time

00:03:36.616 --> 00:03:38.017
to stop wearing their masks.

00:03:38.017 --> 00:03:39.819
[ Laughter ]

00:03:39.819 --> 00:03:41.821
One of the guy's friends
was like, "Don't worry.

00:03:41.821 --> 00:03:44.623
You'll find another mute,
helmet-wearing synth-pop artist

00:03:44.623 --> 00:03:46.859
who pretends he's a robot
that you can start a band with."

00:03:46.859 --> 00:03:49.128
[ Laughter ]

00:03:49.128 --> 00:03:50.496
Hey, get this.

00:03:50.496 --> 00:03:54.300
I saw that a 18-karat-gold
PlayStation 5 is on sale

00:03:54.300 --> 00:03:56.602
for half a million dollars.

00:03:56.602 --> 00:03:58.470
Here's a photo. Look at this.

00:03:58.470 --> 00:03:59.639
Wow. Yeah.

00:03:59.639 --> 00:04:01.975
Apparently, one of these
shows up in the new movie

00:04:01.975 --> 00:04:03.643
"Scarface: The Tween Years."

00:04:03.643 --> 00:04:06.346
[ Laughter ]

00:04:06.346 --> 00:04:09.315
Well, guys, while most of the
country waits to get vaccinated,

00:04:09.315 --> 00:04:12.251
two women in Florida were caught
trying to cut the line

00:04:12.251 --> 00:04:13.753
in a pretty strange way.

00:04:13.753 --> 00:04:14.854
Watch this.

00:04:14.854 --> 00:04:16.455
-The Florida Department
of Health says

00:04:16.455 --> 00:04:18.591
two women dressed up
as "grannies"

00:04:18.591 --> 00:04:21.427
to try and get a second
coronavirus vaccine this week.

00:04:21.427 --> 00:04:25.164
The sheriff's office says the
women were 44 and 34 years old,

00:04:25.164 --> 00:04:27.800
apparently wearing bonnets,
gloves, and glasses

00:04:27.800 --> 00:04:30.169
when they went to the
Orange County Convention Center.

00:04:30.169 --> 00:04:32.271
[ Laughter ]

00:04:32.271 --> 00:04:33.939
-The nurse was like, "Names?"

00:04:33.939 --> 00:04:35.942
And they were like,
"Uh, Grace and Frankie?"

00:04:35.942 --> 00:04:37.876
[ Laughter ]

00:04:37.876 --> 00:04:40.580
Officials got suspicious when
the women didn't call six times

00:04:40.580 --> 00:04:41.848
to confirm the appointment.

00:04:41.848 --> 00:04:44.050
[ Laughter ]

00:04:44.050 --> 00:04:46.319
-Yeah.

00:04:46.319 --> 00:04:47.887
-Yeah, the women gave
themselves away

00:04:47.887 --> 00:04:50.590
when they seemed unfamiliar with
CBS's prime-time lineup.

00:04:50.590 --> 00:04:56.262
[ Laughter ]

00:04:56.262 --> 00:04:58.664
In Florida, the only way
to prove that you're a senior

00:04:58.664 --> 00:05:01.100
is if you have a lower back
tattoo of Andy Williams.

00:05:01.100 --> 00:05:04.103
Wait, that's not true.
Are you sure?

00:05:04.103 --> 00:05:05.838
And finally, this is strange.

00:05:05.838 --> 00:05:08.107
I saw that federal agents
in Ohio just made

00:05:08.107 --> 00:05:11.143
a pretty, pretty surprising
discovery. Check this out.

00:05:11.143 --> 00:05:14.246
-Customs agents in Cincinnati
found something stronger

00:05:14.246 --> 00:05:16.315
than sugar on
a shipment of Corn Flakes.

00:05:16.315 --> 00:05:19.685
The cereal was topped with
44 pounds of cocaine

00:05:19.685 --> 00:05:22.822
worth nearly $3 million.

00:05:22.822 --> 00:05:24.490
-It's serious.

00:05:24.490 --> 00:05:27.460
The suspects are expected to
receive a sentence of 20 years

00:05:27.460 --> 00:05:29.262
to cinnamon life in prison.

00:05:29.262 --> 00:05:33.466
[ Laughter ]

00:05:33.466 --> 00:05:35.067
I think the whole incident
explains why

00:05:35.067 --> 00:05:39.505
the Corn Flakes mascot
went from a rooster to this.

00:05:39.505 --> 00:05:40.940
[ Rooster crowing ]

00:05:40.940 --> 00:05:42.075
[ Laughter ]

